.TH "kitten-update-self" "1" "Jul 30, 2026" "0.48.2" "kitten Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
kitten-update-self \- Update this kitten binary
.SH "نحوه استفاده (USAGE)"
.SY "kitten update-self [options]"
.YS
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Update this kitten binary in place to the latest available version.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.BI "--fetch-version" " [=latest]"
The version to fetch. The special words latest and nightly fetch the latest stable and nightly release respectively. Other values can be, for example: 0.48.2.
.TP
.BI "--help, -h" " [=no]"
Show help for this command
